#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To get information about a qubit's state, you can _measure_ it onto a [classical bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). In Qiskit, measurements are performed in the computational basis, that is, the single-qubit Pauli-$Z$ basis. Therefore, a measurement yields 0 or 1, depending on the overlap with the Pauli-$Z$ eigenstates $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Um Informationen über den Zustand eines Qubits zu erhalten, kannst du es auf ein [klassisches Bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit) _messen_ (_measure_). In Qiskit werden Messungen in der Berechnungsbasis durchgeführt, das heißt, der Ein-Qubit-Pauli-$Z$-Basis. Daher liefert eine Messung 0 oder 1, abhängig von der Überlappung mit den Pauli-$Z$-Eigenzuständen $|0\\rangle$ und $|1\\rangle$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a measurement to a circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Eine Messung auf einen Circuit anwenden {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to apply measurements to a circuit:\n"
msgstr ""
"Es gibt mehrere Möglichkeiten, Messungen auf einen Circuit anzuwenden:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"
msgstr "`QuantumCircuit.measure` Methode {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure)"
" method to measure a "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class).\n"
msgstr ""
"Nutze die Methode "
"[`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure),"
" um einen "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class) zu messen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Examples:\n"
msgstr "Beispiele:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Measure` class {#measure-class}"
msgstr "`Measure` Klasse {#measure-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit "
"[Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure)"
" class measures the specified qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Qiskit Klasse "
"[Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure)"
" misst die spezifizierten Qubits.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"
msgstr ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` Methode {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To measure all qubits into the corresponding classical bits, use the "
"[`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all)"
" method. By default, this method adds new classical bits in a "
"`ClassicalRegister` to store these measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Um alle Qubits in die entsprechenden klassischen Bits zu messen, nutze die "
"Methode "
"[`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all)."
" Standardmäßig fügt diese Methode neue klassische Bits in einem "
"`ClassicalRegister` hinzu, um diese Messungen zu speichern.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-"
"method}"
msgstr ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` Methode {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-"
"method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To measure all qubits that are not idle, use the "
"[`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active)"
" method. This method creates a new `ClassicalRegister` with a size equal to "
"the number of non-idle qubits being measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"Um alle Qubits zu messen, die nicht im Leerlauf sind, nutze die Methode "
"[`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active)."
" Diese Methode erstellt ein neues `ClassicalRegister` mit einer Größe gleich"
" der Anzahl der nicht im Leerlauf befindlichen Qubits, die gemessen "
"werden.\n"

